,"","",""]]},"coverage":{"All sections":"curated by hand for the Oct 12 edition from live sources (see links)"},"caveats":["Unlock % are Grok Bot estimates from access tier, harness, effort defaults and habits, anchored on Anthropic's Claude Code study (novice ~15% vs expert ~28–33% verified success). No cross‑lab study measures this.","Moved since Sep 21: OpenAI everyday 25–40 → 30–45 (GPT‑6 default on all tiers incl. Free); Anthropic researcher 65–80 → 70–85 (Opus 5.5 reaches Fable ceiling at Opus price).","Usage: ChatGPT >1.2B weekly (OpenAI); Gemini app >1B monthly (Google, Aug); Grok ~117M monthly AI‑feature users (SpaceX S‑1, Mar); Claude app ~56M monthly (Reuters/Sensor Tower, Jun). Mobile DAU figures via BofA/Sensor Tower are secondary. Codex + Work \"40M active\" has no stated window.","Argon AA 53 / Coding 63.8% shown though not public. Prices: Argon intro $2/$10 (later $4/$20); 3.8 Flash intro $0.75/$3.75; Astra $10/$50. Grok 4.6‑high #72 · 1454 on Arena.","AI Daily Brief notes paraphrase Nathaniel Whittemore’s episode transcripts (aidailybrief.ai, Sep 22 – Oct 1), incl. reactions he quoted; commentary, not data.","Full landscape (Oct 12): one row per company's latest/best model. Arena = LMArena Text Oct 8; AA = Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index Oct 12 (best effort setting). * = AA partial estimate. Kimi K3 & Hy3 counted open‑weight per AA/licence. Mistral Large 4 is a proprietary preview. Microsoft MAI‑Thinking‑1, ByteDance Seed, Baidu ERNIE AA, Perplexity Sonar and SSI have no public text‑leaderboard score. Microsoft's strongest public ranks are in images (MAI‑Image‑2.6 #2 text‑to‑image Arena, vendor‑reported).","SSI: no model, paper or API as of Oct 2026; $32B valuation (Apr 2025 round) and ~$5B Nvidia investment (Jul 27, Bloomberg‑reported size). Rumoured August model did not ship. Thinking Machines: Inkling (975B/41B active, open weights, Jul 15) + Tinker fine‑tuning platform. Perplexity retired Sonar Chat Completions Sep 27; Agent API routes to OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, xAI, Z.AI, Moonshot, NVIDIA plus Sonar. ARR >$450M (Mar, FT via secondary tracker).","Harness figures are mixed quality: official = Claude Code >$2.5B run‑rate (Feb 12), Codex 5M+ weekly (Jun 2). Secondhand/estimates = Cursor ~$4B (Jun), Cognition ~$1B (Sep), Replit ~$525M (Apr), v0 6M+ users, OpenClaw 3.2M MAU (SimilarWeb est.). Claude Code ~$15B “tracked ARR” is a third‑party estimate, not shown. Lovable >$600M ARR via TechCrunch. Bolt $40M is Mar 2025, no newer figure. Lovable/Bolt model stacks are third‑party reporting. Hermes = Nous Research’s Hermes Agent (open source) + Hermes 4 models.","Capability overhang: ceiling = AA Intelligence; reach = ceiling × midpoint of unlock estimate. Argon has no public access (reach 0). Meta Muse Spark (60–75/35–50: Meta AI app, limited dev harness) and MiMo (65–80/15–30: open weights + cheap API, little consumer surface) are derived estimates. MiMo beats Grok 4.7 (both 46) on LMArena rank.","Vendor benchmark tables treated as claims; LMArena and Artificial Analysis are independent."],"links":[{"t":"x.ai Grok 4.7","url":"https://x.ai/news/grok-4-7"},{"t":"docs.x.ai","url":"https://docs.x.ai/developers/grok-4-7"},{"t":"GPT‑6.1 Sol","url":"https://openai.com/index/introducing-gpt-6-1-sol"},{"t":"Sol docs","url":"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/models/gpt-6.1-sol"},{"t":"GPT‑6 for everyone","url":"https://openai.com/index/gpt-6-for-everyone/"},{"t":"DevDay recap","url":"https://openai.com/index/devday-2026-recap/"},{"t":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/29/openai-launches-gpt-6-1-sol-says-it-nearly-matches-gpt-6-astra-and-costs-less/"},{"t":"Opus 5.5","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-opus-5-5"},{"t":"Sonnet 5.5","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-sonnet-5-5"},{"t":"Haiku 5.5","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/claude-haiku-5-5"},{"t":"Gemini 4 Argon","url":"https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/models-and-research/gemini-models/gemini-4-argon/"},{"t":"LMArena Text","ur